; The first set of colours are the gender specific colours of the bag
; The second set is used for the Bag graphic (green outline, black highlight) and the arrow for selecting the item (red)
; The third set is where we get into the ribbon colours; this one is red and green
; The fourth is blue and green
; The fifth is blue and yellow
; The sixth is purple and yellow
; The seventh is white (unused) and orange

